summary.label:
A perfect radio, memories of childhood;
The App contains most of the regional radio stations in China;

National radio: Central Radio, CNR Radio, news radio, People's Radio and other radio stations, bring you the latest information every day;
Provincial radio: not only contains the most popular radio stations in Beijing, Shanghai, Guangzhou and Shenzhen, but also contains the most popular radio stations in each province and city, so that you can hear the most familiar hometown sound no matter where you are;
Internet radio: Huaiji Sound of Music, Early Morning Music, AsiaFM Asian Music Station, Internet radio, Chinese classics and other popular radio stations;
Audio content: novels, children, music, information, emotional life, entertainment, history, crosstalk storytelling, humanities, opera, talk show, automobile, tourism, business and finance, film, IT technology, etc.

Can add [custom] radio station;
Radio [music song] identification;
Radio [music lyrics] recognition;
Support [CarPlay] vehicle functions;
Support background radio playback;
Support to play radio playback;
Support font size and font size Settings;
Can use the previous to the next control station switch;
The function is simple and easy to operate, including favorites, boot playback, timing off and other functions;
Can reflect the playback status of the relevant radio station to the developer and add the relevant missing radio station;

